# Email recipients (VERONICA MARK)

Transactional notifications must be sent **only** to:

1. **The client** (customer / form submitter) — their personalized template  
2. **Super Admin inbox** — `sales@veronicamark.com` (or `PLATFORM_ADMIN_EMAIL` if set)

## Do not

- Send order or form notifications to Brand Manager accounts  
- Send to brand `contactEmail` fallbacks  
- BCC or CC extra inboxes  

Admin copies use `notifyAdminEvent` / `contact.internal_notify` via `getPlatformAdminEmail()` in `lib/email/admin.ts`.
